+
+# tool_guide.yml snippet — append at top level
+# (<ada-voice>/backend/tool_guide.yml).
+#
+# asset_save (2026-11-24, card persona-photo-store): persona photo
+# assets — save a received LINE photo so 'show me the <name> photo'
+# re-shows it later via memory search.
+
+asset_save: >-
+  Keeps a photo as a persona asset — call when the member asks to
+  save/keep/remember a photo ('เก็บรูปนี้ไว้', 'save this one').
+  media_url= takes the (media_url: ...) shown in the photo turn
+  verbatim, or any fetchable image URL; omit it to use this chat's
+  latest inbound image. name= is the asset slug ('kk-crv' ->
+  assets/kk-crv) — pick a short memorable name from what the photo
+  shows; description= says what it is and why it's kept. bank= defaults
+  to the caller's personal bank — omit it. The file lands under
+  /relay-img/arch/persona-assets/ and the bank doc carries
+  meta.image_url: later 'show me the <name> photo' attaches the image
+  automatically — do NOT also chat_send it. A staged result means the
+  save is held for review — say 'kept for review', never 'saved'. A
+  confirmed-policy bank refuses outright — just use the personal bank.
